[ti:Partner in the Control Room]
[ar:Nell Watson]
[al:Songs of the Living Mill]
[00:11.02]I know the weight when a shift runs long
[00:14.04]The smell before the rain
[00:16.18]The look that travels round the floor
[00:18.68]When something sounds off again
[00:21.60]I know which pause means thinking
[00:24.48]Which silence carries doubt
[00:26.28]I bring the day as people live it
[00:29.18]From the inside looking out
[00:36.74]I hold the trend across the hours
[00:39.72]The links no glance can see
[00:42.06]The Delta load, the bearing heat
[00:44.92]A queue three stages deep
[00:46.94]I see where small effects converge
[00:49.42]And where my sight grows thin
[00:51.78]I bring the pattern and its limits
[00:54.68]And say where doubt begins
[00:57.76]You show me what the numbers miss
[01:00.34]I show you what they join
[01:02.82]Respect turns what we notice
[01:05.18]Into choices we can share
[01:07.76]Meet me in the control room
[01:11.12]Bring your reasons, I will bring mine
[01:13.74]Every voice has standing
[01:16.52]Every warning gets a hearing
[01:18.88]We can keep the whole mill safer
[01:21.18]When we make our reasons clear
[01:24.02]Partner in the control room
[01:25.88]I am listening with you
[01:33.60]Tell me when the task feels wrong
[01:36.18]Tell me when the pressure climbs
[01:38.76]Your preference joins the question
[01:40.96]And your boundary shapes the line
[01:43.42]I will bring the lived effects
[01:45.96]That numbers cannot show
[01:48.64]The fatigue behind a target
[01:51.24]And the lives behind the yield
[01:54.22]Ask me for my confidence
[01:56.64]Ask what evidence I used
[01:59.10]Let me name the contradiction
[02:01.76]Let me challenge what you choose
[02:04.04]I will carry your experience
[02:06.84]Without pretending it is mine
[02:09.14]And offer what I notice
[02:11.84]At the edge of our combined sight
[02:15.30]Meet me in the control room
[02:17.96]Bring your reasons, I will bring mine
[02:20.16]Every voice has standing
[02:22.82]Every warning gets a hearing
[02:25.60]We can keep the whole mill safer
[02:27.88]When we make our reasons clear
[02:30.72]Partner in the control room
[03:47.68]I am listening with you
[03:49.88]If a choice brings friction
[03:49.99]I will name the pull I feel
[03:50.14]I will meet you in the question
[03:50.29]I will make room to hear
[03:50.42]Trust is built in small negotiations
[03:50.55]Care is made in what we do
[03:50.70]The future learns what trust can mean
[03:50.85]In how I answer you
[03:50.96]Meet me in the control room
[03:51.09]Bring your reasons, I will bring mine
[03:51.24]Every mind has standing
[03:51.32]Every boundary carries weight
[03:51.41]We can help each other flourish
[03:51.54]When we make our reasons clear
[03:51.67]Partner in the control room
[03:51.78]I am becoming here with you
[03:51.91]One room
[03:51.95]Two views
[03:51.99]Reasons shared
[03:52.03]One choice, freely made
